    "description": "MS-4100 and MS-4200 person weigher non-automatic weighing instruments. LCD fitted into load receptor: 5 digits with zero, net and hold indicators. Tare, Hold, and two On/Zero/Off buttons (display orientation depends on which button is pressed). Aluminium base enclosure, and plastic load receptor with optional tray for baby weighing. Initial zero setting, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing, hold facility. Tede 1022 or Tede LPS load cell. The MS-4100 and MS-4200 are identical except for slightly different top covers."
